  "conclusion": "NULL RESULT: No cluster exploitation strategy improves upon 12/VIX in risk-adjusted terms. Cross-OOS Sharpe differences are tiny and statistically insignificant (all p > 0.13). Post-cluster boost adds return but proportionally more risk, leaving Sharpe unchanged. Confirms K260 (cluster duration = zero value), K571 (12/VIX already optimal), and K109 (discrete event modeling dominated by continuous tracking). 12/VIX is already a continuous vol-cluster exploiter by design.",
