  "significance": "\u25cb",
  "key_insight": "12/VIX is a continuous vol-cluster exploiter by design. When VIX=40 (cluster), weight=0.30; when VIX drops to 20 (cluster end), weight=0.60. This automatic scaling IS the cluster exploitation. Discrete overlays add complexity without improvement."
